{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48800","headline":"游马耳山 · 萧頴士","name":"游马耳山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹山表东服，远近瞻其名。\n合沓尽溟涨，浑浑连太清。\n我来疑初伏，幽路无炎精。\n流水出溪尽，覆萝摇风轻。\n高深变气候，俯仰暮天晴。\n入谷烟雨润，登崖云日明。\n乾坤正含养，种植总滋荣。\n草树皆秀色，雏麋乱新声。\n攀岩挹桂髓，洞穴拾瑶英。\n此地隐微迳，何人得长生。\n宿心尚葛许，弥愿栖蓬瀛。\n太息宦名路，迟回忠孝情。\n还丹昧远术，养素惭幽贞。\n安得从此去，悠然昇玉京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧頴士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}